        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 220306, 6 Inch Recessed Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull features a low profile that makes it a good choice for use on sliding pocket doors. It is mortised into the face of the door for a clean look once installed. The 6 Inch Recessed Pull is available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-220306-specifications.gif?v=1704354528 \"width=\"423\" height=\"291\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 220306 Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/4-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-emtek-220304\"><b>4\" Flush Pull</b></a> , <a href=\"/products/7-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-emtek-220307\"><b>7\" Flush Pull</b></a> , <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/10-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-emtek-220310\"><b>10\" Flush Pull</b></a> , and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/14-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-emtek-220314-1238145\"><b>14\" Flush Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 220306 Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish brad nails.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-220306-specifications.pdf?v=1704262380\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 220306 Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
